Time Capsule Quiz is a memory quiz that uses only the photos on your device.

“When was this?” “Where was this?” — A photo sleeping in your album suddenly becomes a question. Inside the time limit, recall when or where it was taken. A mosaic or cover slowly clears, so the more you remember, the better your chance.

Highlights
• Questions are built from photos on your device. Photos are not uploaded to a server
• Modes: Random / When? / Where?
• Hints for place or date when available
• A 10-question run ends with your score and remaining time, and you can share a result card
• Japanese, English, Chinese, and Spanish

The premium plan unlocks timeout and difficulty controls, plus options for screenshots and downloads.

Refresh your memory with a forgotten photo — try one today.
